---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base>
  <section class="container" style="padding-block:var(--space-8)">
    <p class="eyebrow">✦ Form Builder</p>
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,6vw,3.5rem);margin:var(--space-3) 0">Cari responden, tanpa ribet.</h1>
    <p style="max-width:52ch;color:var(--text-muted)">
      Bikin form dengan tampilan sendiri, bagikan link-nya, dan lihat jawabannya di dashboard.
      Cocok buat kuesioner skripsi.
    </p>
    <p style="margin-top:var(--space-5)"><a class="btn" href="/dashboard" aria-disabled="true">Segera hadir</a></p>
  </section>
</Base>
